      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027ve redone it to use 2 bits per child (what is the ChildType?) and one bit per uniform scalar (is it float or int?). I feel like this should be pretty space efficient but still gets us a tight key. We could do more for uniforms if you think one bit per scalar is still too big (think RLE), but for your average shader I think this should be plenty efficient. WDYT?",
